+### sweagent/utils/__init__.py
+"""Utility subpackage for SWEAgent.
+
+This package provides helper functions and classes used across the
+project.  An empty ``__init__`` file is required so that ``setuptools``
+recognises ``sweagent.utils`` as a proper Python package during the
+build process.  Without it the ``utils`` directory would be omitted from
+the installed distribution, leading to import errors at runtime.
+"""
